them, are used only to say what the translators read and write. They are
trademarks of their owners: among them Oracle, Microsoft Excel, Drools and
Apache KIE (the Apache Software Foundation), Camunda, DMN and OMG (the
Object Management Group), OASIS and LegalRuleML, Daml and Canton (Digital
